================================================================================
Robot hand URDFs and meshes
================================================================================

The robot hands shipped under dexplore/data/assets/<robot>_hand/ are derived
from the dex-urdf project (https://github.com/dexsuite/dex-urdf) with the
following Dexplore-specific modifications by Sirui Xu:

  - A 6-DOF floating-base wrist (3 prismatic + 3 revolute joints) prepended to
    each hand, exposed as the first 6 actuated DOFs of every Dexplore_<Robot>
    task.
  - Decimated collision meshes added under each hand's meshes/ directory for
    Isaac Gym physics performance.
  - The inspire_hand_new/ asset is a SolidWorks-based rebuild of the Inspire
    hand to match hardware in the authors' lab; it is not a verbatim copy of
    the dex-urdf inspire_hand.

